      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangfu-complete:received_sentence2-63",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAACA",
      "source_quote": "敷先設二牀，去壁三四尺，二客就席，敷呼左右曰：「移我遠客！」",
      "reading": "敷設二牀，去壁三四尺，命左右將自己移遠。",
      "note": "敷設二牀，去壁三四尺，命左右將自己移遠。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangfu-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 63,
      "end_codepoint": 93,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangfu-complete:received_sentence2-93",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAACA",
      "source_quote": "赳等失色而去。",
      "reading": "周赳等失色而去。",
      "note": "周赳等失色而去。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangfu-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 93,
      "end_codepoint": 100,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangfu-complete:received_sentence2-100",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAACA",
      "source_quote": "其自標遇如此。",
      "reading": "史家據此說敷自處的方式。",
      "note": "史家據此說敷自處的方式。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangfu-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 100,
      "end_codepoint": 107,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangfu-complete:received_sentence2-107",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAACA",
      "source_quote": "善持音儀，盡詳緩之致，與人別，執手曰：「念相聞。」",
      "reading": "敷出言持重而緩，與人別時執手。",
      "note": "敷出言持重而緩，與人別時執手。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangfu-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 107,
      "end_codepoint": 132,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangfu-complete:received_sentence2-132",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAACA",
      "source_quote": "餘響久之不絕。",
      "reading": "聲音餘響不絕。",
      "note": "聲音餘響不絕。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangfu-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 132,
      "end_codepoint": 139,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangfu-complete:received_sentence2-139",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAACA",
      "source_quote": "張氏後進皆慕之，其源起自敷也。",
      "reading": "張氏後進效其音儀，溯源於敷。",
      "note": "張氏後進效其音儀，溯源於敷。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangfu-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 139,
      "end_codepoint": 154,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangfu-complete:received_sentence3-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAACA",
      "source_quote": "遷黃門侍郎、始興王濬後將軍司徒左長史。",
      "reading": "遷黃門侍郎及始興王劉濬幕府官，後軍／司徒兩職的讀法與宋62對照。",
      "note": "遷黃門侍郎及始興王劉濬幕府官，後軍／司徒兩職的讀法與宋62對照。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangfu-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 19,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangfu-complete:received_sentence3-19",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAACA",
      "source_quote": "未拜，父在吳興亡，成服凡十餘日，方進水漿，葬畢，不進鹽菜，遂毀瘠成疾。",
      "reading": "未拜即遇父喪。成服十餘日始進水漿，葬後毀瘠成疾。",
      "note": "未拜即遇父喪。成服十餘日始進水漿，葬後毀瘠成疾。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangfu-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 19,
      "end_codepoint": 54,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangfu-complete:received_sentence3-54",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAACA",
      "source_quote": "伯父茂度每譬止之，敷益更感慟，絕而復續。",
      "reading": "伯父張裕字茂度，勸止反使敷慟哭愈甚。",
      "note": "伯父張裕字茂度，勸止反使敷慟哭愈甚。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangfu-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 54,
      "end_codepoint": 74,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangfu-complete:received_sentence3-74",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAACA",
      "source_quote": "茂度曰：「我比止汝，而乃益甚。」",
      "reading": "茂度自稱我，稱敷為汝。",
      "note": "茂度自稱我，稱敷為汝。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangfu-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 74,
      "end_codepoint": 90,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangfu-complete:received_sentence3-90",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAACA",
      "source_quote": "自是不復往，未朞年而卒。",
      "reading": "茂度不復往，敷未滿一周年即卒。",
      "note": "茂度不復往，敷未滿一周年即卒。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangfu-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 90,
      "end_codepoint": 102,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-046-zhangfu-complete:received_sentence3-102",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "d50_8f5_wul_AAACA",
      "source_quote": "孝武即位，旌其孝道，追贈侍中，改其所居為孝張里。",
      "reading": "劉駿即位後旌表，追贈侍中，改其居里名孝張里。",
      "note": "劉駿即位後旌表，追贈侍中，改其居里名孝張里。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-046-zhangfu-complete:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 102,
      "end_codepoint": 126,
      "human_reviewed": false
